  "title": "Marica's Spaghetti Meat Sauce",
  "description": "Plenty of onions, carrots and celery go into this extra meaty tomato sauce, thick with minced beef and pork. A host of dried herbs add earthy notes to the simmer, and a handful of fresh mushrooms are stirred in at the last minute.",
